Subject: [PATCH 02/11] ntdll: Bridge D3DMetal calls to SysV Unix exports.

Port CrossOver 23015 for the nine semaphore, event, handle and thread exports used by libd3dshared. Dispatch Microsoft ABI calls only for return addresses in the explicitly loaded dylib; retain Proton implementations and the default SysV path.
